  "description": "Years of production: 2023-2026\n\nPreceded by the Jeht Gen1. See the current Jeht.\n\nNot too little. Not too much. Just right. The second generation Jeht was our all-mountain trail bike: 140mm of travel, aggressive Longshot handling and a UK-made Reynolds 853 steel frame that brought the FlareMAX's charismatic, alive ride feel to bigger, more demanding terrain. The bike that took you from local evening blasts to high mountain days without asking you to compromise.\n\nIt had a muscular, purposeful feel: more planted and controlled than you might expect from steel, but never muffled or dead. The droplink suspension delivered traction and smoothness through the rough stuff, while the frame filtered out the fatiguing buzz on long, hard days. The handling was slack enough to commit fully on steep, technical descents, yet it pedalled efficiently and climbed with poise.\n\nFinishes: Gloss Crimson and Matte Sage, plus our full A La Carte custom colour range.\nSizes: C1, C2, C3, C4 and C5. Wheels: 29\", or 29\" front / 27.5\" rear mullet. Rear travel: 140mm.",
